The glob view reads CRLF files like LF ones in every engine: a header comment of several lines
joins them with spaces, a Markdown file without frontmatter shows its setext heading, and data
files without a header show their field summary, with a multi-line TOML string on one line and no
`\r` anywhere.
== args
input
== file input/crlf.md escaped
Title\r
=====\r
\r
Intro.\r
\r
## Section\r
text\r
